{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ekholux\u2122 \u2014 A VR Shock Unlike Anything You've Experienced</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world fractured by meaning, where the puzzle isn't just mechanical\u2014it's embedded in your flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock sound-reactive puzzles. Shatter obstacles with motion. Race across gravity-defying rails in a sensory gauntlet that tests your reflexes and redefines immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted by internationally awarded VR artist Hsin-Chien Huang, Ekholux\u2122 fuses the cerebral thrill of escape-room logic with the visceral rush of extreme movement\u2014engineered for those who crave a new kind of full-body storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm twisted by echoes, sound isn't just a clue\u2014it's the language reality runs on.Harness your Ekho Capsule to activate dormant systems, reveal hidden paths, and recover fractured memories buried deep within corrupted architecture. This isn't just a puzzle\u2014it's a confrontation with the remnants of human consciousness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extreme Sport Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every puzzle sequence, the tempo spikes. You're propelled into a velocity-fueled run through high-speed rails, carving across zero-gravity curves\u2014every twist synced to the pulse of electronic sound. Blending the raw thrill of parkour, skateboarding, and snowboarding, this is more than motion\u2014it's an otherworldly adrenaline surge. No gear. No brakes. Just your body, your rhythm, your courage.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915940?t=1761644910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915940?t=1761644910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915940/842e06a9b5cd165b6eeb65fede62aa8d0e774aea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761644910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915940/842e06a9b5cd165b6eeb65fede62aa8d0e774aea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761644910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ekholux\u2122 \u2014 A VR Shock Unlike Anything You've Experienced</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world fractured by meaning, where the puzzle isn't just mechanical\u2014it's embedded in your flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock sound-reactive puzzles. Shatter obstacles with motion. Race across gravity-defying rails in a sensory gauntlet that tests your reflexes and redefines immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted by internationally awarded VR artist Hsin-Chien Huang, Ekholux\u2122 fuses the cerebral thrill of escape-room logic with the visceral rush of extreme movement\u2014engineered for those who crave a new kind of full-body storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm twisted by echoes, sound isn't just a clue\u2014it's the language reality runs on.Harness your Ekho Capsule to activate dormant systems, reveal hidden paths, and recover fractured memories buried deep within corrupted architecture. This isn't just a puzzle\u2014it's a confrontation with the remnants of human consciousness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extreme Sport Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every puzzle sequence, the tempo spikes. You're propelled into a velocity-fueled run through high-speed rails, carving across zero-gravity curves\u2014every twist synced to the pulse of electronic sound. Blending the raw thrill of parkour, skateboarding, and snowboarding, this is more than motion\u2014it's an otherworldly adrenaline surge. No gear. No brakes. Just your body, your rhythm, your courage.</p>","developers":["NarriFlux"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915940/3bbd8aea9a13bc1f8cacd34575380ae28b9ea977/header.jpg?t=1761644910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3915940/555679879/0d2ad161242627b4168404066df8ff518cb3830d/1755231892/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755541388","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3915940/555679879/0d2ad161242627b4168404066df8ff518cb3830d/1755231892/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755541388","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3915940/555679879/0d2ad161242627b4168404066df8ff518cb3830d/1755231892/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755541388","id":257183498,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183498/movie480.mp4?t=1755541388","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183498/movie_max.mp4?t=1755541388"},"name":"Ekholux Extreme Sport Mode Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183498/5e290243ac263ad3bf9969f7c56cf651aa175da2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755541388","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183498/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755541388","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25718